### 3. Invariant Verification & Mathematical Proof of Termination

1. **Chapter I, Art. 1.3 (Absolute Prohibition of Carceral Coercion & Somatic Integrity):**  
   The amendment strictly rejects indefinite confinement, starvation, or forced labor of hostile saboteurs. When demographic loading compromises the node's physical survival baseline, detainees are neither killed nor carcerally warehoused. Instead, they are channeled through an automated demilitarized truce egress or released into perimeter buffer zones equipped with survival essentials.
2. **Chapter I, Art. 1.4 (Lexicographic Priority of Abiotic and Somatic Survival):**  
   The mathematical viability operator does not stall when high-entropy synthetic consumables run low. The patch explicitly decouples water continuity from vulnerable, single-point global supply chains by:
   - Requiring a dedicated 90-day stoichiometric precursor reserve ($P_{monomer} \ge 3 \times C_{baseline}$);
   - Mandating local closed-loop pyrolytic chemical synthesis within Tier 2-A fab-labs;
   - Enforcing immediate load-shedding of Tier 3 discretionary energy use to power metabolic synthesis during interdiction.
3. **Determinism and Anti-Technocracy:**  
   The protocols operate on deterministic physical triggers (severance of $>50\%$ of physical corridors, metric drop in 30-day abiotic reserves) rather than discretionary administrative decrees. This prevents bureaucratic or oligarchic usurpation during states of kinetic emergency.